  m_text: '1. Make sure you''ve met the minimum coins for withdrawals. Please note
    that the exchange rate for coins to cash is updated daily


    2. Select the
    withdrawal platform, and enter your account for this platform correctly


    3.
    After your request is processed, the funds will be transferred to your chosen
    account soon,also we will notify you as soon as the order is finished


    4.
    One withdrawal account can receive rewards up to 5 different devices, if you
    use more than 5 devices, your withdrawal application will be rejected


    5.
    If any abnormal application of cheating is found, the withdrawal application
    will be rejected'
